sequenceDiagram
    actor User as 👤 User
    participant FE as React Frontend
    participant BE as Express Backend
    participant ML as FastAPI ML Service
    participant DB as MongoDB Atlas
    participant OSM as OpenStreetMap API
    participant CLD as Cloudinary
    participant WS as Socket.IO

    Note over User, WS: === User Registration & Login ===
    User->>FE: Fill Registration Form
    FE->>BE: POST /api/auth/register
    BE->>DB: Create User Document
    DB-->>BE: User Created
    BE-->>FE: JWT Token + User Data
    FE-->>User: Redirect to Dashboard

    Note over User, WS: === Property Search & View ===
    User->>FE: Enter Search Query + Filters
    FE->>BE: GET /api/properties?city=Baner&bhk=2
    BE->>DB: Query with Compound Index
    DB-->>BE: Filtered Properties Array
    BE-->>FE: Paginated Results
    FE-->>User: Display Property Cards + Map

    User->>FE: Click on Property Card
    FE->>BE: GET /api/properties/:id
    BE->>DB: Log Interaction (view) + Fetch Property
    DB-->>BE: Property Details + Owner Info
    BE-->>FE: Property Detail Data
    FE-->>User: Property Detail Page with Map

    Note over User, WS: === AI Price Prediction ===
    User->>FE: Enter BHK, Area, Zone, etc.
    FE->>BE: POST /api/predict-price
    BE->>ML: POST /predict (Proxy)
    ML->>ML: GradientBoosting Model Inference
    ML->>ML: RandomForest Confidence Interval
    ML-->>BE: Predicted Price + CI Range
    BE-->>FE: Prediction Response
    FE-->>User: Display Price + Chart

    Note over User, WS: === Owner Lists Property ===
    User->>FE: Fill Property Form + Upload Images
    FE->>BE: POST /api/properties (multipart/form-data)
    BE->>CLD: Upload Images via Multer
    CLD-->>BE: CDN Image URLs
    BE->>OSM: Geocode Address
    OSM-->>BE: Lat/Lng Coordinates
    BE->>DB: Save Property (status: pending)
    DB-->>BE: Property Created
    BE->>WS: Emit "new_listing" to Admin Room
    WS-->>User: Real-time Notification
    BE-->>FE: Success Response
    FE-->>User: Redirect to Dashboard

    Note over User, WS: === Send Inquiry ===
    User->>FE: Type Inquiry Message
    FE->>BE: POST /api/inquiries
    BE->>DB: Create Inquiry Document
    BE->>DB: Increment Property inquiryCount
    BE->>WS: Emit "new_inquiry" to Owner
    WS-->>User: Owner Receives Alert
    BE-->>FE: Inquiry Sent Confirmation
    FE-->>User: Success Toast
